{"unit_id":"shixiong0529__dsh-schedule-enable#card-zh","repo":"shixiong0529/dsh-schedule-enable","commit":"15f36fa8ee5a8a0d7c84a19ebe66c0ea2ca413ba","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-schedule-enable 是一个用于 DeepSeek Harness 的调度插件，可在组合 profile 中插入内置 schedule 与 time-context 覆盖层。它通过 bundle 补丁启用会话级持久化调度能力，使活跃根 Agent 获得创建、查看和删除提醒的工具。用户可以安排延迟提醒、指定时间提醒或周期提醒，也可以查看和移除活跃提醒。适合希望让 DSH Agent 在当前会话中管理定时任务的人。需要兼容版本的 DeepSeek Harness、Node.js 及提供会话持久化等服务的 profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:12-17"]}
{"unit_id":"shixiong0529__dsh-schedule-enable#card-en","repo":"shixiong0529/dsh-schedule-enable","commit":"15f36fa8ee5a8a0d7c84a19ebe66c0ea2ca413ba","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-schedule-enable enables built-in scheduling in a composed DeepSeek Harness profile. Active root agents can create, list, and delete persistent session reminders for delayed, timed, or recurring tasks. Requires a compatible Harness and Node.js.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:12-17"]}
